# This stack's routes: <service>|<name>|<port>[|<options>], one per line (options:
# nodot, tls — see render_routing_override in scripts/library/common.sh). Rendered on every
# self-check into docker-compose.override.yml beside the deployed stack, once per
# routing domain of the box (routing_domains in scripts/library/common.sh), so the
# compose file itself names no domain.
# Dex, the box's OIDC broker. Its issuer is auth-${DOMAIN}: dash form only.
dex|auth|5556|nodot
# Authelia, the "Local Account" connector behind Dex: a distinct host from Dex's.
# Its issuer is dash-form too. It serves HTTPS itself (the auth stack's own
# certificate, see ensure-authelia.sh), so Caddy speaks TLS to it.
authelia|local-auth|443|nodot,tls
# The identity console, through its gate.
auth-console|auth-console|80
